{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "OA Corp Course：教室名稱複製按鈕",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "(corp-courses-copy-btn) 在課程頁面麵包屑導覽列後，新增一鍵複製教室名稱的按鈕",
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://corp.orangeapple.co/courses/dt/*"
      ],
      "js": [
        "content.js"
      ],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    }
  ],
  "icons": {
    "16": "icon16.png",
    "48": "icon48.png",
    "128": "icon128.png"
  }
}